{"seq":2,"slug":"investment-principles","title":"投资原则","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/core-contributions/investment-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quality-over-cheapness","title":"以合理价格买入优质企业","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/core-contributions/investment-principles/quality-over-cheapness","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"circle-of-competence","title":"能力圈与耐心","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charlie-munger/core-contributions/investment-principles/circle-of-competence","wordCount":1752,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"投资原则\">投资原则</h1><p>本章论述查理·芒格的核心投资原则。芒格深刻地改变了传统价值投资的理念，提出&quot;以合理的价格买入优质企业，远胜于以便宜的价格买入平庸企业&quot;，使价值投资从&quot;捡烟蒂&quot;进化为重视企业品质的成熟理论。同时，他强调投资者应坚守自己真正理解的&quot;能力圈&quot;,以极大的耐心等待绝佳良机，并在确信无疑时集中重仓出击。本章呈现的，是芒格历经数十年实践检验的投资智慧。</p>\n"}